      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Civil War, a two‑day skirmish at Doniphan Ford on the Current River in 1862 pitted Union Captain Leeper against Confederate Reverend Reeves.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
